  "description": "Shared render and scene data types used by the OutWit.Controller.Render controller — host-side in adapters, node-side in distributed batch processing. Adds per-task/per-batch scene Attachments (RenderTaskData.Attachments, RenderTaskBatchData.Attachments) so render nodes can materialize external scene dependencies locally, and RenderSceneAttachmentRefData.Frame for per-frame baked-simulation cache slicing (each node receives only its frames' cache); appended last for wire back-compat (empty/null reproduces legacy self-contained behaviour). RenderBakeOptionsData configures the host-delegated simulation bake (Render.BakeSimulation) that converts an unbaked sequential sim into a per-frame OpenVDB cache on the best node before distribution. 1.8: the render job document vocabulary — the request DTOs (sceneRef, options, tileOptions, videoOptions, bakeOptions) and the validate/preflight results are published as [JobDocumentContract] types, with the schema fragment and C++/Python bindings shipped under documents/.",
